d 'TVTIE': module to estimate time-varying true individual-effects stochastic frontier models
d
d    tvtie estimates the stochastic frontier model of Kutlu, Tran,
d and Tsionas (J. Econometrics, 2019). The model separates
d individual heterogeneity    from one-sided inefficiency.
d Individual effects may vary over time, with a distinct
d coefficient vector for every panel. A    within-panel orthogonal
d projection removes these coefficients before maximum-likelihood
d estimation. 
d
d KW: stochastic frontier
d KW: inefficiency
d KW: individual effects
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260915
d
d Author:  Levent Kutlu,  University of Texas Rio Grande Valley
d Support: email event.kutlu@@utrgv.edu
d
f tvtie.ado
f tvtie.sthlp
f tvtie_estat.ado
f tvtie_example.do
f tvtie_example.dta
f tvtie_nonlinear.dta
f tvtie_p.ado
f tvtie_postestimation.sthlp
f ../_/_tvtie_bootstrap.ado
f ../_/_tvtie_expand.ado
f ../_/_tvtie_load.ado
f ../_/_tvtie_mata.ado
